OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mostly dry and
OL,6,Fbright with occasional sunny breaks.
OL,7,FHowever, there will be the odd shower.
OL,8,FFeeling chilly in the moderate to
OL,9,Ffresh west or northwest winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FCloudy or partly cloudy
OL,12,Fduring this evening and overnight with
OL,13,Fa scattering of showers. Light or
OL,14,Fmoderate west or northwest winds.
OL,15,
OL,16,CMonday:FMainly dry with bright spells,
OL,17,Falthough it could turn dull over
OL,18,FShetland with patchy light rain
OL,19,Fthrough the afternoon. Light or
OL,20,Fmoderate northwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
