OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FPlenty
OL,6,Fdry and settled weather under a large
OL,7,Farea of high pressure. Variable cloud
OL,8,Famounts with some clear or sunny
OL,9,Fspells possible at times. Light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
